The appendix indicates that bays twelve through thirty are blocked and designated for supplier vans only.[[cite:obs-8aaecd8e4fe734453974ade72ed2cd692fab5f69 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]]

